{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301080","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130108001:1":{"text":"그럼요, 소렌 형은 언제나 우리 부족을 지켜주는 엄청나게 대단한 사람이라고요!","source_cn":"没错，索恩哥哥非常厉害，他保护着我们的部落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EB3A81A6B9A6F05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130108002:1":{"text":"저도 소렌 형처럼 되고 싶어요!","source_cn":"我想变得和索恩哥哥一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F265F346AA13C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130108003:1":{"text":"그리고 소렌 형의 그 과묵한 성격도 너무 멋있어요!","source_cn":"而且索恩哥哥总是不说话这一点，我也超喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523200D566EB4C05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血瑟巴":{"text":"세르바","source":"小蛮血瑟巴","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}